  "title": "engine-test-utils & Testing Strategy",
  "description": "How reliable tests are written for a stateful, file-system-heavy, git-aware, VS-Code-integrated note engine. This harness (plus the integ runner in plugin-core) is what makes it possible to have confidence when changing core algorithms. Advanced testing techniques for monorepo plugin development.",
  "ref": "codetour",
